    "en": "A short incremental game where you collect fish for your lab. Synced to music. 100,000 fish on screen Hover your cursor over fish to collect on the beat. Use a variety of tools to collect as many fish as you can. The lab gets huge Every fish you collect earns you money. As you play the lab automatically grows. Choose how to power your tools Decide which tools get extra power. Upgrade your lab and equipment Write grants to unlock big equipment upgrades on top of the 200+ upgrades in the tech tree. Extra Game Modes Sandbox Endless Zen - installable as a real Windows screensaver"
